---
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
import ActionLink from '../components/ActionLink.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import '../styles/pages.css';
---

<Shell title="页面未找到">
  <div class="inner-page missing-page">
    <header class="view-head">
      <div>
        <p class="section-label"><span class="section-marker"><Icon name="arrow-right" size={15} /></span> 404</p>
        <h1>找不到这一页</h1>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="surface-panel missing-panel">
      <p>这个地址没有对应的页面。可以回到主页，或在归档里查找文章。</p>
      <div class="missing-actions">
        <ActionLink class="section-action" href="/" direction="back"><Icon name="arrow-left" size={17} cue /> <span data-action-label>返回主页</span></ActionLink>
        <ActionLink class="section-action" href="/archive/" direction="forward"><span data-action-label>查看归档</span> <Icon name="arrow-right" size={17} cue /></ActionLink>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Shell>
